#N canvas 0 0 450 190 10;
#X obj 42 47 inlet;
#X obj 42 100 t b a a;
#X obj 42 150 outlet;
#X obj 100 100 send pocketpd-display;
#X obj 100 130 send $1;
#X text 190 47 display - show the last received message in the widget. The PocketPd canvas renders the message inside this box\; messages pass through untouched. The app gives every display a unique receive tag (creation arg 1\, the [send $1] above)\; a bare [display] from an imported patch mirrors the shared pocketpd-display channel;
#X connect 0 0 1 0;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 1 1 2 0;
#X connect 1 1 3 0;
#X connect 1 2 4 0;
